            "The second mistake is to “be weary,” to faint, when reproved. This is the believer who treats every hardship as a sign that God has given up on her. One failure, one exposure, one hard word from the pastor, and she concludes, “Tapos na ako. Galit na sa akin ang Diyos.” She stops praying, stops attending, and hides. That is not humility. It is unbelief wearing humility's clothes. It doubts the love that the very same verse declares.",
