        "If you are in a hard season right now, I want you to change your prayer. Keep telling God honestly how much it hurts; He can handle your tears. But add one more line: “Father, what are You training in me?” Then be still and listen. Read Hebrews 12 slowly this week. If the Spirit shows you a sin, confess it quickly and turn. If He shows you nothing, do not invent guilt. Simply trust Him, keep obeying, and wait for the “later” of verse 11.",
